    {
      "id": "p9-childhood-school.spelling-and-cane",
      "title": "黑板前的听写",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.032,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 6,
          "max": 9
        },
        {
          "kind": "placeKind",
          "in": [
            "school"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 6,
          "maxAge": 9
        },
        {
          "key": "teacher",
          "kind": "teacher",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 22,
          "maxAge": 65
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": false,
          "minAge": 6,
          "maxAge": 11
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "spelling-all-correct",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "他站在黑板前，粉笔在手里有点打滑，但每个词都拼对了。老师用指节敲了敲黑板沿，让全班跟着他念一遍，窗边的孩子也跟着张嘴。回座位时，同桌用胳膊肘碰了碰他。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "skill",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "skill": "literacy",
              "amount": 0.05,
              "reason": "听写全对，拼写得到练习"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$teacher",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.06,
              "respect": 0.04,
              "reason": "老师对他留下好印象"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "spelling-all-correct",
              "text": "粉笔灰落在他袖口上，他拼完最后一个词，听见老师嗯了一声，全班跟着念时声音嗡嗡的，像炉子上的水壶。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "spelling-all-correct",
              "text": "他回座位时手心是干的，同桌凑过来看他石板上的划痕，后排有人小声说这不算什么，但老师已经翻开了下一页。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "spelling-stuck-word",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "卡在一个带变音符号的长词上，他咬着嘴唇写错了两回。老师的手杖敲在他手心上，不重，但火辣辣地发麻。放学后他留在空教室里，把那个词抄了十遍，值日生扫地时绕开他的长凳。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.02,
              "reason": "手心挨了手杖，发麻"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.06,
              "reason": "当众受罚并留堂抄写"
            },
            {
              "type": "skill",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "skill": "literacy",
              "amount": 0.03,
              "reason": "反复抄写那个长词"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "spelling-stuck-word",
              "text": "手杖落下时他数着数，第三下之后老师让他回去。那个词在石板上越写越歪，教室里的煤炉快灭了，他呵气暖手指。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "spelling-stuck-word",
              "text": "值日生把椅子倒扣在桌上，扫帚扫到他脚边时停了一下。他抄到第八遍，听见院子里雪被踩实的嘎吱声，知道同路的孩子已经走了。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "spelling-copied-from-neighbor",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "他斜眼瞟见同桌石板上的拼法，照着写上去，居然全对。老师让他解释词尾为什么这么变，他张着嘴说不出话，脸烧起来，手指在石板边缘蹭来蹭去。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.04,
              "reason": "抄同桌答案后心虚"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": -0.03,
              "reason": "同桌发现他偷看，有点不快"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "spelling-copied-from-neighbor",
              "text": "同桌把石板往自己那边挪了挪，动作不大，但他看见了。老师还在等答案，窗外的雪光把黑板上的白字照得刺眼。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "spelling-copied-from-neighbor",
              "text": "他听见自己的声音细得像蚊子，后面的孩子吃吃笑。老师摆摆手让他坐下，粉笔在手里转了个圈，接着叫下一个人。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-childhood-school.report-card",
      "title": "成绩单上的红字",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.0288,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 9,
          "max": 11
        },
        {
          "kind": "placeKind",
          "in": [
            "school"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "householdSize",
          "min": 3
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 9,
          "maxAge": 11
        },
        {
          "key": "teacher",
          "kind": "teacher",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 22,
          "maxAge": 65
        },
        {
          "key": "parent",
          "kind": "parent",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 25,
          "maxAge": 55
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": false,
          "minAge": 25,
          "maxAge": 65
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "report-card-hidden",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "他把成绩单折起来夹进课本，晚上等母亲去厨房，自己用蘸水笔在家长签字栏描了一个歪扭的名字。第二天老师翻到那一页，看了很久，把本子合上，只叫他课间到讲台边站一会儿。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.05,
              "reason": "伪造签名被老师识破，心里发慌"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$teacher",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": -0.08,
              "reason": "老师发现他模仿家长签名"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "report-card-hidden",
              "text": "蘸水笔尖刮纸，那个名字写得比算术题还慢。第二天老师用拇指蹭了蹭签名，什么也没说，只是让他把课本拿回去。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "report-card-hidden",
              "text": "课间他站在讲台边，看别的孩子分吃一块果酱面包。老师改作业时头也没抬，粉笔灰落在红字旁边。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "report-card-read-aloud",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "母亲把成绩单递到楼下杂货铺，请老板娘念。红字被大声读出来时，母亲的手在围裙上擦了又擦。周末去普拉特的计划当场取消，他留在家里擦地板，肥皂水浸得指缝发白。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.07,
              "reason": "红字被当众念出，周末计划取消"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$parent",
              "kind": "kin",
              "trust": -0.05,
              "obligation": 0.04,
              "reason": "母亲因成绩单失望，让他多做家务"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "report-card-read-aloud",
              "text": "老板娘念到“上课说话”时抬了抬眉毛，母亲没吭声，把那张纸对折两次塞进围裙口袋。回家路上她走得很快，他跟在后面数石板缝。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "report-card-read-aloud",
              "text": "擦地板时他闻到杂货铺带回来的咖啡渣味。母亲在灶台前削土豆，皮掉进盆里的声音比平时重。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "report-card-ask-retest",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "他攥着成绩单去找老师，说想补算术。老师从眼镜上方看了他一会儿，从抽屉里抽出一张旧试卷，让他第二天中午来。母亲听说后，把晚饭的汤多盛了半勺给他。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "skill",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "skill": "numeracy",
              "amount": 0.04,
              "reason": "向老师争取补考机会"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$teacher",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": 0.06,
              "respect": 0.03,
              "reason": "老师愿意给他一次机会"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "report-card-ask-retest",
              "text": "试卷纸又薄又黄，上面印着去年的日期。老师用手指点了点第一道题，说先把这个弄明白，别的再说。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "report-card-ask-retest",
              "text": "母亲没问补考的事，只是把汤碗推过来时多看了他一眼。汤里飘着一小片香肠，他拿面包蘸着吃完了。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-childhood-school.corner-punishment",
      "title": "讲台边的墙角",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.0256,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 7,
          "max": 11
        },
        {
          "kind": "placeKind",
          "in": [
            "school"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "health",
          "min": 0.4
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 7,
          "maxAge": 11
        },
        {
          "key": "teacher",
          "kind": "teacher",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 22,
          "maxAge": 65
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": false,
          "minAge": 7,
          "maxAge": 11
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "corner-full-lesson",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "他举着石板站满了一整节课。下课铃响时胳膊像灌了铅，回座位时石板差点磕到桌角。后排有人学鸡叫，老师回头瞪了一眼，教室才安静下来。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.03,
              "reason": "举石板站了一节课，胳膊酸痛"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.05,
              "reason": "被罚站并遭同学取笑"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "corner-full-lesson",
              "text": "石板边缘硌着手指，他换了好几次手。窗外院子里的雪被踩成黑泥，别的孩子在煤堆旁追跑，声音隔着一层玻璃。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "corner-full-lesson",
              "text": "回座位时同桌帮他托了一下石板底，他甩着胳膊坐下，听见自己肩膀咔地响了一声。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "corner-teacher-called-away",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "老师被校长叫到走廊上，门虚掩着。同桌悄悄站起来，替他托住石板底，两人憋着笑。老师回来时同桌已经坐好，老师扫了一眼，没看出什么，让他把手放下。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "friend",
              "trust": 0.08,
              "affection": 0.05,
              "reason": "同桌冒险替他托石板"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.03,
              "reason": "有人帮忙，心里好受些"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "corner-teacher-called-away",
              "text": "同桌的手心全是汗，托了半分钟就缩回去。走廊上传来校长皮鞋踩在木地板上的声音，两人赶紧分开，石板晃了一下又稳住。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "corner-teacher-called-away",
              "text": "老师回来时带进一股冷风，她翻开点名册，好像忘了墙角还站着人。他放下石板时胳膊已经不太听使唤。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "corner-slab-down-seen",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "趁老师转身在黑板上写字，他把石板放到讲台边，甩了甩手。后排两个孩子看见了，其中一个举手喊了一声。老师让他重新举起来，这一回多站了半节课。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.04,
              "reason": "被加罚多站半节课"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": -0.05,
              "reason": "被后排同学告发"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "corner-slab-down-seen",
              "text": "举报的孩子声音很响，老师粉笔停在半空。他弯腰重新拿起石板时，听见身后有人压低嗓子笑。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "corner-slab-down-seen",
              "text": "多站的半节课里，他盯着黑板上那行字，每个字母都像在晃。铃声再响时，他学乖了，等老师走远才把石板放下。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-childhood-school.bench-friend",
      "title": "长凳中间的位置",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.0288,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 7,
          "max": 11
        },
        {
          "kind": "placeKind",
          "in": [
            "school"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "notHasRelation",
          "relationKind": "friend"
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 7,
          "maxAge": 11
        },
        {
          "key": "neighbor",
          "kind": "neighbor",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 7,
          "maxAge": 11
        },
        {
          "key": "teacher",
          "kind": "teacher",
          "required": false,
          "minAge": 22,
          "maxAge": 65
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "bench-share-bread",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "他从口袋里掰了半块面包推过去，同桌愣了一下才接。放学两人同路走了一段，同桌在巷口说他就住在前面的煤铺楼上。第二天早上，同桌在长凳上给他留了一块烤土豆皮。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "food",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": -1,
              "reason": "分给同桌半块面包"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "friend",
              "trust": 0.1,
              "affection": 0.08,
              "reason": "分面包和同路回家，结下友谊"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "bench-share-bread",
              "text": "面包掰开时掉了几粒渣在长凳缝里，同桌捡起来吃了。煤烟味混着面包的酸味，他不太习惯，但没挪开。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "bench-share-bread",
              "text": "巷口的风把两人的帽子吹歪，同桌伸手替他按了按。烤土豆皮在口袋里捂到早上，还带着一点温热。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "bench-follow-nickname",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "他跟着别人叫了两声外号，同桌没回嘴，只是把石板往中间挪了挪，一整天没再说话。放学时他看见同桌一个人往煤铺方向走，书包带子断了一边，拖着地。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.04,
              "reason": "跟别人叫外号后感到不舒服"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
              "kind": "acquaintance",
              "trust": -0.06,
              "reason": "叫同桌外号，伤害了对方"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "key": "bench-follow-nickname",
              "text": "外号喊出口时，旁边几个孩子笑起来。同桌低头用袖子擦石板，擦了很久，石板上的灰已经干净了。",
              "tone": [
                "matter-of-fact"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "alt",
              "key": "bench-follow-nickname",
              "text": "回家路上他老想起那条断书包带。母亲问学校里怎么样，他说没事，把土豆汤喝得呼噜响。",
              "tone": [
                "dry"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "bench-duty-together",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "他请同桌一起留下来做值日，两人抬水、倒煤灰。老师回来拿忘带的伞，看见他们并排扫地，就把两人的座位调开了，说上课还是少说话为好。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$neighbor",
